  "body": "The spec currently has three examples under \"5 Fetch API\", using ES6 syntax. Since the document is pretty long, it would help a lot to have some usage examples at the start of the spec, for example as part of the \"Goals\" section, similar to the examples in the [Web Audio spec](http://webaudio.github.io/web-audio-api/#modular-routing). I also suggest using at most ES5 syntax for those examples.\n\nWhat would those examples accomplish? A lot of specs, including this one, are mostly written for implementers. Getting early feedback from users is generally desirable, but often hindered by the lack of usage examples. Adding those, or in this case, making them easier to find, would make the spec a lot more accessible.\n",
